            "notes": "",
            "description": "Data playbook (PB4) manually launched by an analyst from the container once they've reviewed the artifacts/notes PB1-PB3 produced. Prompts for a comment, then assigns the TRAP incident to SOAR, moves its status from new to open, and posts the comment. Independent of proofpoint_trap_triage/proofpoint_trap_close."
